// `_self_` means "this package", so a lone script — reached without a `noeta.toml`, deriving no
// package prefix — has nothing for it to stand for. Reported as that, rather than as the "no module
// `_self_`" it would otherwise cascade into, which describes the symptom and not the cause.
// expect: error E0019 at 6:1
// expect: exit 1
use _self_.models

echo 1
